{"v":4,"catch":"進入 Bricky to Me 並嘗試逃離這座隨機的城堡！","desc":"Bricky to Me 是一款益智平台遊戲，它帶來了隨機佈置房間的想法。 加入城堡中的騎士和一隻神秘的貓，整個場景被動態修改，創造出令人難以置信的挑戰來克服的房間。\n\n遊戲呈現了一個簡單但懲罰性的遊戲玩法。 避開陷阱，消滅敵人，解決謎題，收集硬幣，進行正確的跳躍，並確保在打到boss戰之前保持活力，否則你將不得不重新做所有事情。\n\n遊戲特色\n- 60多個房間隨機組合；\n- 有趣的謎題；\n- 一隻需要撫摸的小貓；\n- 一個迴旋鏢來擊敗敵人；\n- 非常不尋常的boss戰；\n\n\n由 IdunaSoft 開發並由 QUByte Interactive 發布","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2022-07-21","genres":["動作","益智","冒險","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fb52eb701cb471a18e81f49d3a3295a60d2dd4e3a7285e1b2578aecde7134936.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/04da2fde8d89b3acf58d0e4fc47a29063fef05b801ba67fb61f05b826b2b665f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f5a5297b533bf9b0f9955f2aae7986fac4f9393e216aa3b9c00420d85e46e30.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e7061915dc0b4ac99d5b0b2a360f3dbc30c17f1145345d49403485bd9a603e0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa2cdcdc1e8f1a622661b88be9eb16a4ec5afe80a203e27f12314ad1b046a95c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eba9746b16165c82ee5cab9b00120b6d675c17f32276010c6008a2b36e1b4719.jpg"],"titleId":"01007400180a4000","dlc":[]}